---
// HandshakeIllustration.astro - Accessible SVG diagram of the Article V Left-Hand Grip
---

<div class="surface-card p-6 sm:p-10 border border-[var(--border)] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
    {/* Geometric Canvas Diagram (Left) */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-64 h-64 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg
          class="w-full h-full"
          viewBox="0 0 360 360"
          fill="none"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          aria-label="Geometric diagram of the SAM-UP Left-Hand Grip"
        >
          {/* Compass grid lines */}
          <circle
            cx="180"
            cy="180"
            r="140"
            stroke="var(--border)"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-dasharray="4 4"
          />
          <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="100" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <line x1="40" y1="180" x2="320" y2="180" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
          <line x1="180" y1="40" x2="180" y2="320" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />

          {/* Left Hand Iconography Frame */}
          <rect
            x="110"
            y="110"
            width="140"
            height="140"
            rx="20"
            stroke="var(--primary)"
            stroke-width="2"
            fill="var(--surface-raised)"
          />

          {/* 3 Joined Fingers Base (Equality, Unity, Loyalty) */}
          <rect x="135" y="140" width="18" height="50" rx="9" fill="var(--primary)" />
          <rect x="160" y="132" width="18" height="58" rx="9" fill="var(--primary)" />
          <rect x="185" y="138" width="18" height="52" rx="9" fill="var(--primary)" />

          {/* Extended Index Finger (Academic Excellence) */}
          <rect
            x="210"
            y="120"
            width="18"
            height="70"
            rx="9"
            fill="#F1F4F9"
            stroke="var(--primary)"
            stroke-width="1.5"
          />

          {/* Spread Thumb (Camaraderie) */}
          <path
            d="M 130 190 C 115 190, 105 205, 105 220 C 105 230, 120 235, 135 225 Z"
            fill="var(--primary)"
          />

          {/* Center Left-Hand Grip Badge */}
          <text
            x="180"
            y="275"
            fill="var(--primary)"
            font-family="monospace"
            font-size="11"
            font-weight="bold"
            text-anchor="middle"
            letter-spacing="0.1em"
          >
            ARTICLE V • LEFT HAND
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-center">
        The Constitutional Grip of Uniqueness, Rigor, and Brotherhood
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Symbology Descriptions (Right) */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-raised)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold mb-1">01. The Left Hand</div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--foreground)] mb-1">
          Uniqueness & Distinct Identity
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          The left-hand handshake distinguishes members from other organizations, symbolizing our unique
          collective standing as applied mathematicians.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-raised)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold mb-1">
          02. Three Joined Fingers
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--foreground)] mb-1">
          Equality, Unity, and Loyalty
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          The middle, ring, and pinky fingers are clasped firmly together, representing the indivisible triad
          of egalitarian brotherhood, communal cohesion, and unyielding organizational loyalty.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-raised)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold mb-1">
          03. Index Finger & Thumb
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--foreground)] mb-1">
          Academic Excellence & Camaraderie
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          The extended index finger embodies rigorous Academic Excellence. The spread thumb signifies open
          Camaraderie. In the grip, the index finger rests firmly between the fellow member's thumb and index.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
